          <h3>Sales Training &amp; In-Services</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="blurb">Give your staff the product knowledge and selling confidence to move every line you carry.</p>
        <ul class="ds-list">
          <li>Staff product education</li>
          <li>Manufacturer-specific training</li>
          <li>New product launch support</li>
          <li>Selling strategies</li>
          <li>In-service scheduling</li>
