        </ul>
        <a class="ds-link" href="?request=Request%20an%20In-Service#request">Schedule an In-Service &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Marketing Support -->
      <article class="ds-card">
        <div class="ds-card-top">
          <div class="ds-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3l4 4V6L7 10H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z"/><path d="M15 8a4 4 0 0 1 0 8"/><path d="M18 5a8 8 0 0 1 0 14"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Marketing Support</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="blurb">Promote your products and your storefront with campaigns and materials built for HME &amp; DME.</p>
        <ul class="ds-list">
          <li>Product launch campaigns</li>
          <li>Dealer marketing materials</li>
          <li>Email campaign support</li>
          <li>Brand and product promotion</li>
          <li>Social &amp; digital marketing guidance</li>
          <li>Manufacturer-specific marketing programs</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="ds-link" href="?request=Marketing%20Support#request">Request Marketing Support &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Business Consulting -->
      <article class="ds-card o">
        <div class="ds-card-top">
          <div class="ds-ico orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 14l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M19 7v3h-3"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Business Consulting</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="blurb">Find the next opportunity — new categories, better margins, and a clear plan to grow.</p>
        <ul class="ds-list">
          <li>Dealer growth strategies</li>
          <li>Product category expansion</li>
          <li>Revenue opportunity identification</li>
          <li>Showroom profitability review</li>
          <li>Cross-selling opportunities</li>
          <li>Business development planning</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="ds-link" href="?request=Business%20Consulting#request">Request Business Consulting &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Product & Manufacturer Support -->
      <article class="ds-card">
        <div class="ds-card-top">
          <div class="ds-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.7l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.7l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><path d="M3.3 7L12 12l8.7-5M12 22V12"/></svg></div>
